# U1 KunMoe/kun-galgame-forum apps/web, commit 0df82167789164e2932f13a58fc470116336e30e
# Hand-derived from the apps/web/app/pages tree (114 .vue files). No definePageMeta path/alias overrides, no pages:extend hook, no router.options.
# Nuxt rules: index -> parent path, [id] -> :id, [[id]] -> :id?, [...slug] -> "*". A parent.vue with a child index.vue shares the index URL
# (app/pages/admin.vue + admin/index.vue, message.vue + message/index.vue, update.vue + update/index.vue). A parent.vue without index child
# is its own URL (app/pages/category.vue, ranking.vue, user.vue). Pages contributed by extends layers (nuxt.config.ts:10) are not included.
